  "content": "\n\n<p>Just Dire Things 最初只是我想加入游戏中的一些随机物品和方块的集合。&nbsp; 然后事情就有点一发不可收拾了……</p>\n<p>本模组添加了：</p>\n<p>4 个层级的资源，需要探索不同的 Minecraft 维度来解锁。</p>\n<p>4 个层级的工具，每种都拥有独特能力，有些更是前所未见！</p>\n<p>4 个层级的护甲，每种都拥有自己的一套独特能力！</p>\n<p>大量围绕自动化设计的方块。&nbsp; 包括：</p>\n<p>方块破坏器/放置器</p>\n<p>传感器</p>\n<p>传送器</p>\n<p>能量生成与分配方块。</p>\n<p>未来还计划加入更多内容，这仅仅是初版！</p>\n<p>模组特写：</p>\n<p>第 1 部分：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/inz9Jx9K9oc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>第 2 部分：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DnnYotwG7qs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>第 3 部分：&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5Jq517MCltM\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>第 4 部分：&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SLPO5Y5Mc7U?ab_channel=direwolf20\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2M8-V8YBayg\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ub6_h3ffnV0\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
